<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" version="2.0"><channel><title>机器之心官方 的 bilibili 空间</title><link>https://space.bilibili.com/73414544</link><atom:link href="http://127.0.0.1:1201/bilibili/user/video/73414544" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"></atom:link><description>机器之心官方 的 bilibili 空间 - Powered by RSSHub</description><generator>RSSHub</generator><webMaster>contact@rsshub.app (RSSHub)</webMaster><language>en</language><image><url>https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/face/cb838ff9e6f57c1d3499621c91df8e013adad4fd.jpg</url><title>机器之心官方 的 bilibili 空间</title><link>https://space.bilibili.com/73414544</link></image><lastBuildDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 00:40:08 GMT</lastBuildDate><ttl>5</ttl><item><title>订阅越久重置越多，Fable 5.2碾压Opus 5.5，30小时搞定费马大定理形式化</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117590986852981&amp;amp;bvid=BV1DJWg6kE8Y&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/6e245cad3c226d555b229d950b956c6f58330074.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;此次视频由Fable 5.2制作。Anthropic发布Claude Fable 5.2、Claude Mythos 5.2两款顶级模型，跑分全面超越Opus 5.5。实测8天从零写出操作系统原型，30小时完成费马大定理形式化证明……价格还降了，大家快来看看吧！</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1DJWg6kE8Y</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1DJWg6kE8Y</guid><pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 07:36:35 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1DJWg6kE8Y" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>爱妻人设崩塌！黄仁勋承认婚外情，英伟达启动调查</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117585433594638&amp;amp;bvid=BV1axWx69EMx&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/7a152554beea16cc216f68588dccff2b96f8f6fc.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;英伟达 CEO 黄仁勋公开为个人婚外情道歉，承认伤害了妻子与家人，同时董事会已针对涉及客户企业的绯闻对象启动独立调查。昔日“17 岁追妻、老婆买皮衣”的恩爱人设瞬间引发讨论，网友调侃离婚风险的同时也在关注股价波动。一起看看怎么回事吧～</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1axWx69EMx</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1axWx69EMx</guid><pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 08:02:39 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1axWx69EMx" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>AI 教父Hinton曾被 NeurIPS 拒稿！李飞飞访谈Jeff Dean，谷歌工程师之神预测也失误？</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117568740264621&amp;amp;bvid=BV1a34B6YEd5&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/47c104f098610040d8bba61ce1264a7d1838c993.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;如今支撑所有大模型轻量化部署的“蒸馏圣经”——由 AI 教父 Geoffrey Hinton 与 Oriol Vinyals 等人联合撰写的开山论文，当年竟被顶级学术会议 NeurIPS 拒稿，理由居然是“不太可能产生任何影响”。这篇如今引用量破 4 万次的神作虽然险些被埋没，但它提出的“教师-学生模型”彻底改变了 AI 工业落地的格局。一起看看怎么回事～</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1a34B6YEd5</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1a34B6YEd5</guid><pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 09:20:04 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1a34B6YEd5" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>鼠鼠吃红利！AI 给小白鼠开颅注射，恢复良好</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117568153126746&amp;amp;bvid=BV1Nk4v61E4f&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/4f1e7d412f7e59c407bee948616106ea9147128c.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;一项针对癫痫的基因治疗实验中，研究团队不仅让 AI 自主评估 19 种治疗方案并检索论文确定注射坐标，还让它直接控制摄像头与针头设备，为小白鼠完成了精密的脑部开颅注射。一起看看怎么回事吧～</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Nk4v61E4f</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Nk4v61E4f</guid><pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 06:49:13 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1Nk4v61E4f" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>ChatGPT Images 2.6来了，动态GIF、SVG导出，还能指哪改哪</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117563002521872&amp;amp;bvid=BV1UP486KEye&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/7d137873839f62e971883a232bc076b21e663d32.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;ChatGPT Images 2.6太适合用来生成一套动态表情包了，可以使用提示词，或使用一张草图，制作动态GIF。这次升级，控制也更细了，可以在图片上标出具体要改的位置，设计好的图像还能导出SVG矢量图。图像生成速度也提升了50%，大家快来看看吧！</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1UP486KEye</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1UP486KEye</guid><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 08:59:47 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1UP486KEye" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>AI引发的数学界新焦虑，陶哲轩:数学家都不敢公开自己的研究了</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117557432485664&amp;amp;bvid=BV1kuxQ6EEjo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/529642b4847be734f45f0d21b1b5444936110afe.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;陶哲轩在最新的演讲中表示，因为担心研究想法被人抢先输入模型并发表，一些数学家开始隐藏自己的研究方向了。他更担心现实风险：当AI用于电网、空管和药物设计时，可能钻模型的漏洞，给出看似合格、却偏离真实目标的答案。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1kuxQ6EEjo</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1kuxQ6EEjo</guid><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 10:30:00 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1kuxQ6EEjo" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>“走进船厂”视比特人形焊接机器人即将进船厂试运行</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117556811664277&amp;amp;bvid=BV1KrxQ64EHq&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/f2c7a3e9b3c05143d54a19352316cd5f6729877a.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;在船厂，机器人得先走到工件旁，才能开始焊接。地面坑洼、工件堆放杂乱，船舱内还有高低落差，轮式机器人通行受限。视比特机器人为此推出全尺寸双足人形焊接机器人。它身高170厘米，全身配备27个高扭矩、高精度关节，可迈步跨过障碍，适应船舱内高低错落的地形。
走到工件旁，还要找准焊缝。面对缺少固定工装的船舶建造现场，它结合激光雷达、ToF相机和3D激光线扫相机感知环境与工件，在3D视觉引导下自主焊接。任务规划、动作规划和运动控制由“大小脑”分层架构协同完成。这款机器人即将进入国内一家头部船厂试运行。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1KrxQ64EHq</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1KrxQ64EHq</guid><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 08:30:00 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1KrxQ64EHq" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>下一代 GPT 露面！奥特曼： AI 是新文艺复兴</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117556409008376&amp;amp;bvid=BV13xxS6fEdi&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/a93e7daec147849e28e05f91eab24d9c6084a819.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;OpenAI 联合阿布扎比国家石油公司展现了 AI 在科研与能源领域的颠覆性突破，即将推出的下一代 GPT 模型驱动了一万个无层级、无老板的去中心化 AI 智能体，通过自主协作成功攻克了首个千禧年大奖难题。Sam Altman 强调，AI 正在从消耗能源转向反哺能源与基础科学，这场技术浪潮远不止是“新工业革命”，而是一场赋予每个人无限创造力与新知识爆发的“新文艺复兴”。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV13xxS6fEdi</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV13xxS6fEdi</guid><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 05:06:00 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV13xxS6fEdi" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>从解决问题到发现问题，AI 研究还要跨过哪些关？</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117556056754027&amp;amp;bvid=BV1s6xS6JERz&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/b05247da470028a173a49bc7ca973758d6c6e489.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;这一期AI Insider，我们邀请了北京大学国际机器学习研究中心助理教授杨灵老师，聊聊 AI 智能体如何从执行任务走向持续学习，以及 AI for Science 面临的挑战。

杨灵老师把自己的研究脉络看作一条连续的链条：从用扩散模型建模真实世界分布，到研究大语言模型的推理能力，再到智能体调用工具、与真实世界交互，最后关注如何沉淀可复用、可复利的经验。这也是 RSI（递归自我改进）希望实现的方向。

杨老师团队探索的 Discovery RSI 又往前推了一步，不只让 AI 解题，还要让它提出新问题、</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1s6xS6JERz</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1s6xS6JERz</guid><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 04:30:00 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1s6xS6JERz" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>探访 Neuralink R1，把芯片接入人脑，为什么需要一台机器人？</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117551946337634&amp;amp;bvid=BV1wc4g6qEbk&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/6db7dc39b643beb342ad7edef1fa3feb74a8a667.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;连接大脑的柔性电极线，细到人手难以完成植入。Neuralink 为此造出了 R1 手术机器人：识别大脑表面的血管，再将细线精准植入脑组织。跟随镜头走进 Neuralink，看看机器人如何完成这项精细操作，脑机接口又如何将运动意图转化为控制电脑的指令，帮助瘫痪患者重新获得与世界互动的能力。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1wc4g6qEbk</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1wc4g6qEbk</guid><pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 12:10:00 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1wc4g6qEbk" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>MIT让GPT直接改Qwen权重，只动0.016%，数学成绩翻6倍</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117552013380910&amp;amp;bvid=BV1yR4u66E9x&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/240a6b1f1a4e9b15b1bfad7832bb2602ec378b9e.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;做可解释性的同学要哭晕在厕所。MIT研究团队做的一个新研究爆了，让GPT-6 Astra检查Qwen3.5-0.8B的内部权重并直接修改，只改了万分之一点六，Qwen的数学成绩就提了6倍，整个过程没有重新训练模型，也没有使用梯度下降。大家快来看看吧！</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1yR4u66E9x</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1yR4u66E9x</guid><pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 10:23:58 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1yR4u66E9x" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>嫌内容太垃圾，Karpathy用Opus 5.5，俩小时重做了一个“YouTube”</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117546325969822&amp;amp;bvid=BV1UV4w6xEZc&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/28792f8c1242ecd16ed251bb587c73657531a48b.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;因为嫌YouTube的推荐内容太垃圾，Karpathy花两个小时，用Opus 5.5为自己量身定做了个YouTube——HackerTube。这里没有花里胡哨的夸张封面，而是直接截取视频中间的一帧，也不需要注册账号，就能为你推荐个性化的内容。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1UV4w6xEZc</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1UV4w6xEZc</guid><pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 10:23:02 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1UV4w6xEZc" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>人类听不懂！两个 AI 靠“脑电波”加密通话</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117544698511453&amp;amp;bvid=BV1Xx4c6tEMv&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/471cfe66a941fdd5d7d7f8a69f5c5563fe6e54be.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;如果 AI 不再使用人类语言，它们会如何偷偷交流？开发者 Sauers 打造的“神经双胞胎”实验中，两个来自不同家族的 AI 彻底绕过了人类可读的文字，直接通过神经网络内部的激活信号进行高效交流。一起看看怎么回事吧～</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Xx4c6tEMv</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Xx4c6tEMv</guid><pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 04:00:00 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1Xx4c6tEMv" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>AI“杀死”LeetCode！大厂允许 AI 面试，难度反而暴涨？</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117529968118161&amp;amp;bvid=BV1VZxi68E9K&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/9f522817a3428567b585be1d9264722261187b1a.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;随着 Anthropic 直接取消 LeetCode 算法测试、Google 允许面试者用 Gemini 找 Bug，程序员苦刷算法题的时代正走向终结。各大科技巨头纷纷重构面试流程，转而考核候选人如何与 AI 协作、能否读懂复杂的 AI 生成代码以及能否识别出深层漏洞。面试不再看“你会不会写”，而是看“AI 写的代码你查不查得出问题”，这对工程师的代码审计与人机协同能力提出了全新考验。一起来看看怎么回事～</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1VZxi68E9K</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1VZxi68E9K</guid><pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 12:59:10 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1VZxi68E9K" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>一张5090实时跑340亿参数，这个世界模型凭什么获英伟达奖？</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117527787079231&amp;amp;bvid=BV1yDxY6qEd1&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/d09d4bac95566afde9c8f2357fbdc16e92eeab24.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;据视频，ScenesAI以单张RTX5090运行340亿参数世界模型，较传统视频扩散，GPU消耗降低40%—60%，推理提速3—5倍。实时可控，能否让世界模型成为交互、仿真与智能系统的新一代基础设施？</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1yDxY6qEd1</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1yDxY6qEd1</guid><pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 09:00:00 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1yDxY6qEd1" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>AI4S越来越深入，背后的算力系统该怎么升级？</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117527854255459&amp;amp;bvid=BV1TyxY6kEvS&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/76ca65b03988f2b8a8ff241d290ce2aa248bbfd2.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;当AI越来越多地走进真实科研任务，背后的算力系统该怎么升级？这次，我们来到了第22届全国高性能计算学术大会的华为展区，鲲鹏拿出创新的超智一体平台给出答案，大家快来看看吧！</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1TyxY6kEvS</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1TyxY6kEvS</guid><pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 04:00:50 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1TyxY6kEvS" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>超越Opus 5.5！Gemini 4 Carbon重回全球第一</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117523643173959&amp;amp;bvid=BV1SExF6nE9n&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/61f7907cc9ed9788316a209cda3fd28e4bf55e26.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Google 发布 Gemini 4 Carbon，全面超越了Opus 5.5！Carbon主打网络安全与长程任务能力，能发现、验证并修复漏洞，内部测试中还能连续数天处理复杂工程问题，甚至把作弊成功率和提示注入攻击成功率都干到了0！</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1SExF6nE9n</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1SExF6nE9n</guid><pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 10:09:25 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1SExF6nE9n" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>开源！英伟达GPU隐藏算力被破解，RTX 4090 吞吐直接翻倍</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117522904910741&amp;amp;bvid=BV1YusZ6UELF&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/069ef95b028ad811f8dbcab89ab1f5148df8e6e0.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;老黄藏了这么久的算力，竟然被挖出来了！无需刷写固件、不用换硬件，RTX 4090吞吐率从166升至332 TFLOPS接近翻倍，3090 Ti提升约80%。目前，20/30/40系均被破解并开源，不过可能伤硬件，谨慎尝试！</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1YusZ6UELF</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1YusZ6UELF</guid><pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 07:02:58 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1YusZ6UELF" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>能探索、会对话、懂逻辑，谷歌最强世界模型Genie 4来了</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117517854967526&amp;amp;bvid=BV1raxE6WEP2&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/f3c10a60cd8c3a2b1f1af525c2750491db359802.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;谷歌发布了最逼真、最具交互性的世界模型 Genie 4，实时操纵世界，还能听见环境声与角色对话。Gemini 也参与规划，让场景发展更有逻辑。不过它仍处于研究预览阶段，感兴趣的朋友快来看看！</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1raxE6WEP2</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1raxE6WEP2</guid><pubDate>Wed, 28 Oct 2026 09:40:05 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1raxE6WEP2" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>从数学金牌到科学发现，AI正在跨越什么</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117517099994327&amp;amp;bvid=BV1yExj6sE2m&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/338d438324bb303b0509fb50df8c339da3271423.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;机器之心联合黄大年茶思屋科技网站，邀请李鹏、张驰、李嘉三位嘉宾，从数学推理、自动定理证明到研究级数学探索，共同讨论 AI 如何成为新型研究协作者。

嘉宾阵容（按分享顺序排列）:

李鹏，清华大学智能产业研究院副研究员
张驰，北京大学智能学院助理教授
李嘉，Project Numina 创始人</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1yExj6sE2m</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1yExj6sE2m</guid><pubDate>Wed, 28 Oct 2026 06:28:30 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1yExj6sE2m" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>成本只要十分之一！GPT-6.1 Terra发布，主打更快更便宜</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117512452771055&amp;amp;bvid=BV1FExg6wEAp&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/99fc999715e25a551a65b395c96837918b81ce9c.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;OpenAI 发布了最新模型 GPT-6.1 Terra：让 AI 看懂屏幕上的东西，然后更快、更便宜地帮你完成电脑上的工作。其中电脑操作能力，GPT-6.1 Terra与GPT-6 Astra 不相上下，但每个 Token 的价格只要十分之一。大家快用起来吧！</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1FExg6wEAp</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1FExg6wEAp</guid><pubDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2026 10:48:11 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1FExg6wEAp" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>全部开源！火爆全网斯坦福 CS336 更新，从零手搓大模型</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117511781747038&amp;amp;bvid=BV1VtxM67EBo&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/3f1d795cbe985fe25749b2d067528f0eb6da6368.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;去年火爆全网的斯坦福大模型神课 CS336 推出全新升级版，全套课程视频与作业资料现已免费开放。课程不仅新增了多模态专题，还涵盖从 Token 化、Transformer 架构搭建到 GPU 并行优化的全流程。配合公开的 5 大核心编程作业，非常适合有 PyTorch 基础的同学跟着从零手搓并跑通属于自己的语言模型。一起来看看怎么回事吧～</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1VtxM67EBo</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1VtxM67EBo</guid><pubDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2026 07:53:17 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1VtxM67EBo" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>AI视频新玩法，Murea-InWorld，开创内容互动新体验</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117505506935770&amp;amp;bvid=BV1khn96VEQc&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/d433ceaa3835cef74dd4e0f0f076a8eac3616f03.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;一句话，改变一段剧情，每个人都是导演，手搓一个故事世界。不用复杂提示词，只需要把你的「想法」说出来，剧情就按指令进行。今天带大家认识全新的互动内容模型--Murea-InWorld。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1khn96VEQc</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1khn96VEQc</guid><pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 05:20:00 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1khn96VEQc" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>奥特曼最新访谈！说好的AI解放人类，怎么反而被榨干了？</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117504902956891&amp;amp;bvid=BV1zenQ6YEgn&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/ba8c1dedae7f3062022bd6dc53a40600cd4625b1.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;虽然 AI 帮我们省了时间、做出了更多工作，但每天要做的各种决定反而变多了，让人到了晚上只觉得精疲力力竭。我们不该像机器里的齿轮一样被越卷越快，而是要学会放手把更多选择权交给 AI，让自己从繁重的决策中解放出来。AI 的终极目的不该是搞一场越拼越累的“工业革命”，而是要带我们走向能有更多时间去创造、去探索生活与爱的“新文艺复兴”。一起来看看怎么回事吧～</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1zenQ6YEgn</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1zenQ6YEgn</guid><pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 02:44:18 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1zenQ6YEgn" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>米哈游把 AI 拉来肝游戏！90亿参数的小模型胜过 GPT、Gemini？</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117489988013409&amp;amp;bvid=BV1b5nh6dEWP&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/ee49bb5eed2f4da8bba202fab71017f2e8d0babe.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;米哈游联合清华等高校，让 AI 看着游戏画面，自己操作键盘鼠标。在游戏不会暂停等它思考的测试里，一个 90 亿参数的小模型，平均成绩竟超过了部分大模型，出手快是关键。这期一起来看看 AI 怎么学打游戏，成为全能游戏玩家～</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1b5nh6dEWP</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1b5nh6dEWP</guid><pubDate>Fri, 23 Oct 2026 11:31:21 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1b5nh6dEWP" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>AI挖出PHP隐藏的高危漏洞，全球网站紧急升级，OpenAI：别急，这才刚开始</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117488494840263&amp;amp;bvid=BV1HWn46PENd&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/4c3db2f7657f8d757b85394e23a6d93125e97d7c.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;这回，全球的程序员都去紧急加班了，因为驱动全球约70%网站的开源编程语言PHP，被GPT‑5.6 Sol 挖出了两个潜伏十几年的超高危漏洞，不用登录，就可能让攻击者远程执行代码。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1HWn46PENd</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1HWn46PENd</guid><pubDate>Fri, 23 Oct 2026 05:13:40 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1HWn46PENd" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>人形全身协同操作的世界动作模型</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117488159362406&amp;amp;bvid=BV1x9n46CEoX&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/661e916f41c9689c753aeadf48a6a7046e3a8dd5.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;本次分享由第一作者解析WholeBodyWAM：复用预训练视觉与操作先验，统一全身控制接口，并以协调注意力引导身体配合操作。结合6项仿真、8项真机任务与失败重试案例，探讨有限人形数据下的全身协同泛化。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1x9n46CEoX</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1x9n46CEoX</guid><pubDate>Fri, 23 Oct 2026 03:46:26 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1x9n46CEoX" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>Github 1.3万星！AI 干掉电视广告，秒变干净苹果风</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117483864460349&amp;amp;bvid=BV1Lanm6JEmd&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/db59740caf5834250f23dd336f713392741faa22.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;一位开发者受够了电视系统广告，用 Claude Code 给电视做了一次彻底大扫除。通过 Wi-Fi 连接电视的 ADB 开发者调试通道，AI 自动备份并停用了 25 个多余软件包，还顺手换上了干净优雅的 Apple TV 风格新桌面。整套流程无需 Root 且支持一键无损复原，现已整理成开源项目 clean your TV 并附带完整 AI 提示词。一起来看看怎么回事吧～</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Lanm6JEmd</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Lanm6JEmd</guid><pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 09:33:26 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1Lanm6JEmd" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>RISC-V迈向数据中心！进迭时空发布服务器级计算芯片V100</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117473294680177&amp;amp;bvid=BV1bxnA6yEiq&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/4061e0bc599779ddff74afb1d82aa39a65842d7f.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;在2026 RISC-V中国峰会上，进迭时空正式发布V100服务器级CPU，业内首颗完整符合RISC-V服务器规范的计算芯片。
V100采用46核混合架构，双路最高可扩展至92核，支持Linux等主流操作系统，并同步推出面向AI计算、数据存储及通用计算的服务器整机。
从芯片到整机，RISC-V正加速迈向数据中心，探索服务器计算的新可能。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1bxnA6yEiq</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1bxnA6yEiq</guid><pubDate>Tue, 20 Oct 2026 12:45:52 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1bxnA6yEiq" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>剑桥助理教授：警惕平庸陷阱，AI 用多了会让人脑腐！</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117471281417320&amp;amp;bvid=BV1oHnF6SEXx&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/6b3e88feef73a8dd8bd3eaa1e5be9d77bb5c3380.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;当所有人都能无门槛使用同款 AI 工具时，技术不仅没有拉开差距，反而通过托底将人群整体向“钟形曲线的中间”拉拢，导致思维与产出严重同质化。过度依赖 AI 替代思考会引发“脑腐”危机，虽然任务产出提高了，但个人判断力与创造力却在悄然退化。如何拒绝被平庸化，正是每个年轻人需要破解的核心命题。一起来看看怎么回事吧～</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1oHnF6SEXx</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1oHnF6SEXx</guid><pubDate>Tue, 20 Oct 2026 04:13:42 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1oHnF6SEXx" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>新任务看一次就会？WorldScape Policy ICL演示机器人的“举一反三”</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117465459721087&amp;amp;bvid=BV1dAnJ6eEc4&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/0c584c7e5e2263d600c29f1818620319f20a58a1.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;人撕薯片，机器人学会撕信封；换一本书、倒转方向，照样完成翻页。两段独立示范，还能组合成“先取鞋、再解鞋带”的连续任务。零样本学习冲泡感冒灵等长程任务也能丝滑掌握。

Manifold AI流形空间展示WorldScape Policy ICL的上下文学习能力：面对模糊指令、多样操作物、多个任务随机组合、干活环境改变等“人类日常”，ICL 将人类示范作为上下文，让模型在执行阶段利用示范适应新任务，不必改变模型参数。在长程推理任务中，WorldScape Policy引入视觉记忆与事件记忆机制，帮助系统保留环</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1dAnJ6eEc4</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1dAnJ6eEc4</guid><pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 03:33:33 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1dAnJ6eEc4" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>陶哲轩批评 OpenAI 不礼貌！年轻人的课题一夜被抢先，AI 正透支数学界未来....</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117459906463298&amp;amp;bvid=BV1fBng6UERy&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/1d14cbe20af28a215a9324c9401684f814b59f75.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;OpenAI 在黎曼猜想相关研究上取得重大突破，连陶哲轩也承认，其中的巧思自己想不出来。但他同时尖锐批评了公司的做法：没有与同行沟通，年轻研究者的课题一夜被抢先；数百篇质量参差的论文突然发布，消化、核查和解释的工作却留给了数学界。公司宣布任务完成，学界的善后才刚刚开始。 当 AI 公司竞相证明“模型能解多少题”，谁来关心这些成果能否被真正理解、催生新问题，以及下一代数学家如何成长？一起来看看怎么回事～</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1fBng6UERy</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1fBng6UERy</guid><pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 04:00:20 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1fBng6UERy" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>扎克伯格×‌亚历山大王，花2000亿训练Muse Wonder，小扎自己心里也没底</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117453900220077&amp;amp;bvid=BV188JY68ExY&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/9900c6c6b0d005858e55e4124e3bf0ea6682a693.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;在扎克伯格和亚历山大王的采访中，小扎亲口承认，还没看到模型的时候，自己就已经准备为Meta首个前沿模型Muse Wonder砸下1000亿甚至2000亿美元，而且当时根本不确定能否成功！</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV188JY68ExY</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV188JY68ExY</guid><pubDate>Sat, 17 Oct 2026 04:00:00 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV188JY68ExY" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>叫板 Steam！Epic 靠 AI 重构启动器，速度比 Steam 快近1.8倍</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117449420703313&amp;amp;bvid=BV1AFJ96rEtF&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/01ca20f251486697d500d74bc6664b95f553edae.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Epic 官方采用 Vibe Coding 全新重构了自家游戏启动器，从底层架构到界面体验进行全面升级，并宣称启动速度大幅超越 Steam。第三方媒体 Ars Technica 现场实测显示，新版进入商店页面较 Steam 确实缩短了约 4.6 秒。虽然目前 Preview 预览版仍存在功能不完善和潜在 Bug，但这标志着 AI 编程已成功跨越实验阶段，正式进入大厂核心级桌面应用的实战重构中。一起看看怎么回事吧～</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1AFJ96rEtF</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1AFJ96rEtF</guid><pubDate>Fri, 16 Oct 2026 07:33:52 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1AFJ96rEtF" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>GitHub 15万星！没源码也能看懂，AI 帮你还原软件源码</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117442793767877&amp;amp;bvid=BV1Q2JC6bEYz&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/67d4363005fed881113a79492ff93d27cbc8b8b6.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;GitHub 斩获 15 万星的开源项目 REA，通过 MCP 接口将 Ghidra、Hopper 等专业工具交由 AI 调度。AI 能自动分析机器指令与伪代码，精准追踪函数调用与数据流，并将其转化为人类易懂的逻辑解释甚至还原出 C 语言代码。一起看看怎么回事吧～</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Q2JC6bEYz</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Q2JC6bEYz</guid><pubDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 03:30:49 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1Q2JC6bEYz" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>API限时五折！Gemini 4 Argon来了，几周完成数月编程工作</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117438532289696&amp;amp;bvid=BV198p26mEfe&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/f93bbe1b616662b93e2bcc9d0be24346e6eec456.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;谷歌 Gemini 4，终于来了！视觉、文字、编程……各方面能力都提升不少，还能分析财报、设计新酶、发现医院漏洞，甚至训练机器人零样本完成了任务！目前Argon 的 API 定价定为输入 2 美元 / 百万 tokens，输出 10 美元 / 百万 tokens，限时优惠，大家快去看看吧！</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV198p26mEfe</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV198p26mEfe</guid><pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 09:26:11 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV198p26mEfe" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>这哥们儿没天文专业背景，借AI发现了新行星？</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117432895212319&amp;amp;bvid=BV1RBWw6tE5b&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/f72d0b72ae42c1a365e6110f116b66a847b5a99c.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;28岁产品经理没有天文专业背景，靠AI分析NASA的TESS望远镜数据，发现一颗恒星亮度规律性下降，于是，他推测这里藏有两颗从未被发现的行星。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1RBWw6tE5b</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1RBWw6tE5b</guid><pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 09:30:28 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1RBWw6tE5b" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>OpenAI 前 VP 深度访谈：AI不会抢人饭碗！未来最吃香的职业是...</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117426972788695&amp;amp;bvid=BV13GpR6AEFr&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/d9461374bb0dab4f48f87a63103b1725d97febd5.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;前 OpenAI 训练后业务负责人深入拆解了 AI 时代的职业演变逻辑，指出“自动化导致失业”源于对“劳动总量固定”的认知谬误，正如 GPT-5 虽能覆盖几年前工程师的大大部分任务，但生产力的提升反而催生了更多复杂的跨职能协作与新岗位。随着智能逐渐被商品化，纯粹重复性的枯燥工位将被替代，而涉及“人与人真实连接、有效协作”以及“搭建 RL 模拟环境、标注长周期专家数据”的新型职业将迎来爆发。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV13GpR6AEFr</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV13GpR6AEFr</guid><pubDate>Mon, 12 Oct 2026 08:27:23 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV13GpR6AEFr" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>评估范式不变，自进化很容易变成过拟合</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117425798383407&amp;amp;bvid=BV1AspX6jEnY&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/490476709ff08c48733fbae0daec3e93a7cac857.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;这一期 AI Insider，我们邀请到复旦大学青年研究员、上海创智学院全时导师曹艺馨老师，聊聊大模型的评估与自进化。

在他看来，这两件其实是同一件事：机器要自己变强，得先回答&quot;什么算进步&quot;，因此评估就像决定下一步往哪里提升的指南针。

但问题在于，评估要从模型能力曲面上有限的几个点，反推出整个分布，现在模型能力很全面，偏差就很严重，直观的体验就是模型看起来分数相近，体验却差很多。

因此，评估的关键不只是造更难、更多样的数据集，而是要提升评估的泛化性：用有限的评估资源，尽可能判断模型在更多维度上的真实</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1AspX6jEnY</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1AspX6jEnY</guid><pubDate>Mon, 12 Oct 2026 04:30:00 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1AspX6jEnY" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item><item><title>OpenAI 又半场开香槟！声称攻克 700 道数学难题后，被打脸？</title><description>&lt;iframe width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; src=&quot;https://player.bilibili.com/player.html?aid=117416050819533&amp;amp;bvid=BV1iAp36JEtP&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/3e3753a92cdcae79422b7c9e21f21853acd0c515.jpg&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;OpenAI 宣称在顶尖数学家指导下攻克了 700 多道数学难题，但随后被研究人员在核查流体方程相关成果时发现，论文中的自然语言证明与提交给 Lean 计算机验证的代码存在不一致，相当于“译前译后两个意思”。一起看看怎么回事吧～</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1iAp36JEtP</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1iAp36JEtP</guid><pubDate>Sat, 10 Oct 2026 11:30:00 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>机器之心官方</dc:creator><enclosure url="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/newplayer.html?isOutside=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;danmaku=true&amp;muted=false&amp;highQuality=true&amp;bvid=BV1iAp36JEtP" length="0" type="text/html"></enclosure></item></channel></rss>